  "description": "Add a row of nodes with value v at a given depth d in a binary tree.",
  "target": "depth: 2, val: 1",
  "pseudocode": "1: if d == 1: return new Node(v, root, null)\n2: queue = [root], currDepth = 1\n3: while currDepth < d - 1:\n4:   for i from 0 to queue.length:\n5:     node = queue.shift()\n6:     if node.left: queue.push(node.left)\n7:     if node.right: queue.push(node.right)\n8:   currDepth++\n9: for node in queue:\n10:  node.left = new Node(v, node.left, null)\n11:  node.right = new Node(v, null, node.right)",
